  "limits": [
    "Fork continuations have a bounded pre-exec syscall subset. A raw child with outstanding registered children must reap them before exec. A shared-VM vfork child doing another vfork receives EOPNOTSUPP.",
    "Pre-exec vfork pointer validation uses the clone-time memory ranges. Concurrent sibling changes to mappings or permissions can invalidate a buffer after validation.",
    "On pre-exec project files, readv/writev are handled per segment via the broker; operations from other processes can interleave. Local pipes and sockets use kernel vectored I/O.",
    "These physical-device results apply to the listed Android 15 device and the supplied aarch64 userspaces. apk database querying was exercised; apk add, distribution upgrades, init and services were not exercised."
  ],
